/given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estrogen receptor, progesterone receptor, HER-2, and response to postmastectomy radiotherapy in high-risk breast cancer: the Danish Breast Cancer Cooperative Group</article-title><source>J Clin Oncol</source><year>2008</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1419</fpage><lpage>1426</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18285604</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1200/JCO.2007.14.5565</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>